## Title: DreadVision
## APIVersion: 101049 101050
## Version: 0.1.4
## AddOnVersion: 104
## Author: Dreadazar
## Description: PvP threat readout. A ring on your reticle that tells you to block, how many roll dodges you can still afford, whether you can pay for a break free, and exactly when you become stunnable. Everything shown is read straight from the game - nothing is estimated or guessed.
